{
  "bodyHash": "CUAnY2cnfUU=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">隆重介紹...</span></strong></em></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_431e20c3-a586-4ab5-8401-b6b4f2c866a1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"848\" height=\"53\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_f3676c42-7dc8-4b04-9afe-3426dbc76486.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"576\" height=\"430\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_79676473-1a6d-4fad-b2a0-0354c02c1912.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"60\"></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"color:#999;font-size:16px;font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_9306c325-d981-449c-bf91-daadf98711d5.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"47\" height=\"47\">|<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#75c232\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:36px\">遠古</span></strong></span><span style=\"color:#75c232\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:36px\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#81432b\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:36px\">自然</span></strong></span>|<img style=\"color:#999;font-size:16px;font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_9306c325-d981-449c-bf91-daadf98711d5.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"47\" height=\"47\"></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>關於</strong></span></h1><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><br>這個模組旨在為您的 Minecraft 世界增添<strong>神奇</strong>且<strong>逼真的<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#e67e23\">史前</span></strong>元素！<br><br></h3><hr><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_de343e78-95a6-4f4a-b87e-782166668c44.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"66\" height=\"49\"></span></h4><h4 style=\"padding-left:40px;text-align:center\">目前這個模組處於<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>第一個測試階段</strong></span>！<br>儘管是測試版，但它包含足夠的內容來提供完整的體驗！<br>帶來新動物、植物、盔甲、方塊、工具、方塊及更多！</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#e03e2d\"><strong>警告：需要 SkullLib！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#e03e2d\"><strong>警告：此專案使用 Mixins，預期會有不相容情況！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#e03e2d\"><strong>建議：我們是唯一獲得授權使用「<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-dawn-era\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">黎明紀元</a>」資源的模組，該資源由 Reaper（以及 Mush Co）擁有。</strong></span></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">內容：</span></strong></h2><hr><p><span style=\"color:#75c232\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">植物：</span></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_1b2b3cae-97d6-4cf3-8064-fdd65739c759.png\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">|</span> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#75c232;text-decoration:underline\">鱗木：</span></span></strong> 一種來自<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fCarboniferous\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">石炭紀</span></a>的高大樹木，提供可食用的毬果，並且可以從其樹幹上剝下鱗片。</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_d181674c-b66e-48d6-bf2a-ad56be63271d.png\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">|</strong></span><strong> </strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#75c232;text-decoration:underline\">銀杏：</span></strong></span> 一種在主世界呈現金黃色和綠色的樹木，金黃色銀杏提供用於復活史前植物的<strong>蕨類琥珀</strong>。</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_1e5e7fbd-b9ea-4dcd-b90b-8796aee98253.png\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">|</strong></span><strong> </strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#75c232;text-decoration:underline\">內溝珊瑚：</span></strong></span> 一種來自<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fPaleozoic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">古生代</span></a>的史前珊瑚，會釋放氣泡，可以用作號角，但會發出有趣的氣泡聲！</li>\n</ul><hr><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#81432b\"><strong>動物：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_a252587f-cb4c-4272-9353-d53d3ee7cc9c.png\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">| <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#81432b\">奇蝦：</span></strong> 來自<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fPaleozoic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">古生代</span></a>海洋中的第一個頂級掠食者。</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_78928e82-2775-4bd8-93a0-88ec2b1cf100.png\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">| <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#81432b;text-decoration:underline\">阿蘭達魚：</span></span></strong> 一種來自<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fOrdovician\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">奧陶紀</span></a>的無頜魚類，在珊瑚附近成群移動。</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_3473dd33-f79c-461c-b08e-a1bbb7abcf8c.png\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">|&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#81432b;text-decoration:underline\">渡渡鳥：</span></span></strong> 一種來自<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fPleistocene\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">更新世</span></a>的有趣而美麗的鳥類，很少在西瓜附近的叢林中生成，西瓜是牠們最喜歡的食物來源。</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_3473dd33-f79c-461c-b08e-a1bbb7abcf8c.png\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">|&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#81432b;text-decoration:underline\">鄧氏魚：</span></span></strong> 一種來自泥盆紀的裝甲掠食者，可以馴服並騎乘，牠的盔甲無法破壞！</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_82e2578f-9ce2-4330-9aed-309486368553.png\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">|&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#81432b;text-decoration:underline\">冠鱷獸：</span></span></strong> 一種來自<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fPermian\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">二疊紀</span></a>的怪物，可以馴服並裝備鞍具或桶子。</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_b846eed4-125d-4b2a-a84a-76fd02d5d8c0.png\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">| <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#81432b;text-decoration:underline\">加卡比龍：</span></span></strong> 一種來自<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fCretaceous\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">白堊紀</span></a>的小型草食性且具領地意識的動物，可以馴服以守衛區域和基地。</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_d9d9b605-3cf8-4ccf-922f-e8c66eead4da.png\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">| <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#81432b;text-decoration:underline\">琥珀蜥：</span></span></strong> 從復活台誕生的失敗品，請盡快銷毀或關在籠子裡。</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_e615dbb4-ae96-4f37-941c-79cc13657338.png\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">| <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#81432b;text-decoration:underline\">劍齒鮭：</span></span></strong> 一種來自<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fMiocene\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">中新世</span></a>的大型鮭魚，會游到海洋和河流中，在河流中繁殖並在海洋中生活，但繁殖後會死亡或變成殭屍。</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_c9aa2aeb-3c2a-4ea6-873f-c7904e012cd7.png\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">| <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#81432b;text-decoration:underline\">副龍骨魚：</span></span></strong> 一種來自<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fCretaceous\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">白堊紀</span></a>的史前大魚，可以用鮭魚餵食後騎乘，能夠在有限時間內衝刺和跳出水面。</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_673f6bdf-3d50-484d-900a-d2bdcbfa1931.png\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">| <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#81432b;text-decoration:underline\">袋狼：</span></span></strong> 一種來自<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fHolocene\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">全新世</span></a>的友好動物，生成在森林生態系中，只有孤獨的幼體可以被馴服，牠們會根據生態系尋找物品。</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_84dfda0e-f8f3-45cb-b5d6-5784d4ab483a.png\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">| <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#81432b;text-decoration:underline\">三葉蟲：</span></span></strong> 一種來自<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fPaleozoic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">古生代</span></a>的裝甲動物，是奇蝦的獵物，牠們會蜷縮成球狀以抵禦危險。</li>\n<li><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_9d76c1b0-b7fa-406c-b270-4ec1f357e7d6.png\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">| <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#81432b\">盾蝦：</span></strong> 一種來自<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fPaleozoic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">古生代</span></a>的史前蝦子，似乎會被珊瑚吸引，牠們具有非常特殊的繁殖和復活方式。</li>\n</ul><hr><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">工具：</span></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_e6538e14-1555-4f4a-a0c9-b24f23d00e47.png\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">|</span> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">鱗木裝甲：</span></strong></span> 提供如盾牌般的保護，並對攻擊者造成傷害。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_5437c47f-4da1-45b4-9fb8-015b3e2efa01.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">|</strong></span><strong> </strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>古生物學家帽子：</strong></span></span> 生成於廢棄礦坑的箱子中，能標示化石的位置。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_37626d23-3c69-4446-93da-828da6b35177.png\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">|</strong></span><strong> </strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>地質學家鎚子：</strong></span></span> 生成於廢棄礦坑的箱子中，可在高效模式（提升化石戰利品）與鎚擊模式（更快破壞更多方塊）之間切換。</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_e3299655-ef48-4f9f-b5ba-eceba75ec29a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f;text-decoration:underline\">|</span></strong></span><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong> </strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>鑿子：</strong></span></span> 用於化石清理小遊戲。</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_e3299655-ef48-4f9f-b5ba-eceba75ec29a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f;text-decoration:underline\">|</span></strong></span><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong> </strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>金瓶子：</strong></span></span> 用於化石清理小遊戲（若裝有水），你的藥水將用之不盡！</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_e3299655-ef48-4f9f-b5ba-eceba75ec29a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f;text-decoration:underline\">|</span></strong></span><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong> </strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>放大鏡：</strong></span></span> 提供化石清理小遊戲中物品的資訊，以及圖騰是否在小遊戲中啟動，也能提供生物的資訊。</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_e3299655-ef48-4f9f-b5ba-eceba75ec29a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f;text-decoration:underline\">|</span></strong></span><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong> </strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>天氣神像：</strong></span></span> 短暫改變天氣。</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_e3299655-ef48-4f9f-b5ba-eceba75ec29a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f;text-decoration:underline\">|</span></strong></span><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong> </strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>圖騰：</strong></span></span> 提升獲得特定生物化石的機率，以你對其強化的生物為目標。</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_e3299655-ef48-4f9f-b5ba-eceba75ec29a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f;text-decoration:underline\">|</span></strong></span><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>甲龍箭矢：</strong></span></span> 具有穿透生物的屬性。</li>\n</ul><hr><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">建築結構：</span></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_e3299655-ef48-4f9f-b5ba-eceba75ec29a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">|</span> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">古生物學家</span> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">帳篷：</span></strong></span><strong> </strong><strong>在這個建築中你能找到「古生物學家」村民和一些戰利品。<br></strong></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_e3299655-ef48-4f9f-b5ba-eceba75ec29a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">|</span> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">地下</span> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">小屋：</span></strong></span><strong> </strong><strong>在這個建築中你能找到「壓碎機」方塊，用於某些合成配方。<br></strong></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_e3299655-ef48-4f9f-b5ba-eceba75ec29a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">|</span> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">銅製</span> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">掩體：</span></strong></span><strong> </strong><strong>在這個建築中你能找到「銅製祭壇」，一種強大的復活史前生物的方法。</strong></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_e3299655-ef48-4f9f-b5ba-eceba75ec29a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\">|</span> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">儀式</span> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">廢墟：</span></strong></span><strong> </strong><strong>在這個建築中你能找到「復活祭壇」，一種古老的復活史前生物的方法。</strong></li>\n</ul><hr><p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">相容模組：</span></strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">亞歷克斯的洞穴</span></strong></span></a>：與亞歷克斯的洞穴有一些互動。</li>\n</ul><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#455085\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">重要：立即加入我們的Discord！</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/6kD935QUyy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#455085\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1372933/description_06ba4b51-f73b-43ed-a191-f50a46ac460e.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"147\" height=\"147\"></span></strong></span></a><br><strong>同時用於回報錯誤與問題！</strong></p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">製作群：</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">總監：Reaper</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">程式設計師：Monkey_biznec、DarkBlade、Axtrough、Oiha、ReinierTheGhost、BlackGear、DinoFazbearYT、VoidArkana 與 Reaper。<br>美術設計：Reaper、Jurnaro、Raina 與 Dororuw。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">音效：Reaper 與 ChipsTheCat。<br>音樂：Reaper。<br>標題 Logo：Curlyfley。<br>特別感謝 RomanSans、Yahrim 和 GibblyJ 一路以來的大力支持！</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
